To explore from place (a whole number) with seen (a whole number).
If place is target and seen is walkable, add 1 to paths.
If place is target, return.
The band is place divided by width.
The file is place modulo width.
If file is more than 0, seek from (place minus 1) with seen.
If file is less than width minus 1, seek from (place plus 1) with seen.
If band is more than 0, seek from (place minus width) with seen.
If band is less than height minus 1, seek from (place plus width) with seen.

